#==============================================================================================
#
#   text_node_2 - Layout::TextNode::ChunkIterator: a text node's text, chunk by chunk
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TextNode.cpp (lines 426-800) and the ChunkIterator members of
#       TextNode.h: the chunks inline layout places one by one (runs of one font and one bidi
#       text type that end at soft wrap opportunities, white space, tabs and preserved line
#       breaks), with the peek queue, the line break opportunities of word-break, and the font
#       a space is drawn in.
#
